\engtitle{.. Shri Gajanana Aratrika ..}##
\itxtitle{.. shrIgajAnanArAtrikA ..}##\endtitles ##
            (geyam)
jaya deva jaya deva jayagajamukhadeva |
sachchitsukhaghanarUpa sarvAnandakara || dhruvapadam ||
o~NkAraikasvarUpa parabrahmAkAra
      sarvAbhayavararUpa nityaM mokShakara |
sarvAmaranutamArchanasaMskR^itapadayugala
      sarvAgraNividhihariharasarvAmararUpa || 1||
timirAj~nAnanivArakadinamaNimatishuddha
      bhavabhayaharachidratnaM sakalAbhIShTakara |
daivIsampatpUritanijasukhakarachandra
      Atmaj~nAnaviraktishreyassiddhikara || 2||
OM gaM gaNapatayenaghamanuvigrahadeva
      sakalapApavinAshakama~NgalamatipUta |
doShaghna pApaghna shApaghna vibhava
      vighnAmbudhishoShaNakaramadbhutamukhakamala || 3||
svAnandAmR^italoka vaidikadharmaguro
      shrutipAvitasachcharitapradamatihitavan |
dharmoddhAradhurINa dharaNIbhAgyakara
      aviratatattvamasIti bodhanapaTudeva || 4||
sumukhavinAyakanAmnA kR^itayugaparipAla
      gaNesha iti nAmnA tu tretAparipAla |
gajamukhanAmnApyevaM dvAparaparipAla
      kalikAmAdinivAraNabrahmAnandakara || 5||

iti shrImat paramahaMsaparivrAjakAchArya sadguru bhagavAn
shrIdharasvAmImahArAjavirachitA shrIgajAnanArAtrikA sampUrNA |

shrIkShetravaradapuraM, gaNeshachaturthI

